  "strDescriptionEN": "Christian Doidge is a 33-year-old Welsh professional footballer who plays as a striker for League Two club Newport County. \r\nDoidge played in the youth systems of Southampton and Bristol Rovers, but temporarily gave up football and played representative basketball instead. He resumed his football career in the Welsh leagues with Cwmbran Celtic, Croesyceiliog, Barry Town and Carmarthen Town. He then moved into English league football with Dagenham & Redbridge, and has since played for Forest Green Rovers and Bolton Wanderers.",
